# Authored text normalises to LF, as in every repo under D:\Dev.
* text=auto eol=lf

# EVIDENCE IS NEVER NORMALISED.
#
# Carried evidence is byte-identical by definition and verified by sha256 in
# EVIDENCE-CARRY.md. Line-ending normalisation rewrites those bytes on checkout,
# so without these lines a fresh clone would hash differently from the manifest
# and tests/test_evidence_carry_intact.py would go red -- reporting tampering
# where there was none, and training whoever sees it to ignore that test.
#
# It is also the subtler failure: normalisation is exactly the kind of
# well-intentioned tidying M001 §4 forbids, applied automatically by a tool
# rather than by a person.
spend_ledger.jsonl      -text
membership_evidence.json -text
handoff/**              -text
